ats people. In this particular story, you take on the role of Reid, the Red Maid of Hotel Milgram.\n\nReid has a simple task: clean the hotel. However, in this story, a previous guest has left behind a zone-esque artifact. A spatial anomaly has also checked in for the week, adding navigation issues to her typically simple tasks. Only the voice of Milgram can guide you through another day. Follow her directions and nothing bad will happen. Not that anything bad can happen in the first place.", "themes": [{"id": 19, "name": "Horror"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/hotel-milgram"}